ReXGlue development commit 01ac2a3 (rexglue-sdk, after v0.10.0): truncate overwrites in place and release the CRT file object.

diff --git a/src/filesystem/devices/host_path_entry.cpp b/src/filesystem/devices/host_path_entry.cpp
